BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sunnycoast-1wg2tgz@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T180000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T200000
SUMMARY:Briscoe Sisters
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from Yalanji country in Far North QLD\, Briscoe Sisters
  have been performing their songs and cultural stories for over two decade
 s. From their early days being recognised as Port Fairy’s Folk Festival
 ’s Matons Young Talent of the year in 2005 and top 4 Deadly’s new tale
 nt in 2004\, the sisters Deline\, Merindi and Naurita spent 10 years touri
 ng to national major events and Festivals across Australia. Highlights inc
 lue performing at CIAF 2018\, Tandanya Spirit Festival in South Australia 
 and performing alongside Yothu Yindi Band at the Yarrabah Music Festival i
 n 2018. With recent performances at Woodford Folk Festival and at The Sydn
 ey Opera House\, Briscoe Sisters are back on tour and performing select Fe
 stivals across Australia bringing Kuku Yalanji language and song to audien
 ces once again. Deline\, Merindi and Naurita’s sister harmonies\, traine
 d in gospel singing from their youth\, makes for an incredibe live show. G
 rounded in their culture and families\, these sisters continue to bring gr
 eat healing and empowerment through their music.
LOCATION:Maleny Community Centre
URL:https://malenycc.org/event/briscoe-sisters/
END:VEVENT
