BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sunnycoast-44qk72@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260919T190000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260919T210000
SUMMARY:Body Type
DESCRIPTION:Over the past decade\, Body Type have established themselves as
  one of Australia’s most acclaimed and compelling bands. Since forming i
 n Sydney in 2016\, they have released two celebrated albums\, earned an Au
 stralian Music Prize nomination\, toured extensively throughout Australia\
 , Europe and the UK\, and shared stages with Foo Fighters\, Fontaines D.C.
 \, Pixies\, Big Thief\, Warpaint\, Sleater-Kinney and Cate Le Bon. Now\, t
 he four-piece return with Tally\, their third album and most ambitious wor
 k to date. Marking the band’s tenth anniversary\, Tally captures a group
  taking stock\, embracing change and pushing their sound into bold new ter
 ritory while retaining the wit\, charm and sharp observations that have be
 come their trademark. Recorded in Los Angeles with acclaimed producer Stel
 la Mozgawa (Warpaint\, Courtney Barnett)\, Tally draws inspiration from a 
 wide range of sources: the work of artist Louise Bourgeois\, misty drives 
 through the Hollywood Hills\, 10 years of history as a band. The album tra
 nsforms the everyday into something surreal\, witty and profound while exp
 loring love\, friendship\, insecurity and the strange beauty hidden within
  ordinary life.
LOCATION:Mapleton Public House\, Mapleton · Nambour + Hinterland
URL:https://tickets.oztix.com.au/outlet/event/a9cfa2c2-da5d-4e03-ba34-599ef
 0462b19
END:VEVENT
