  loved. The kind of set where you go from “I know this one” to “how 
 am I already yelling the chorus” in about 10 seconds 🤘😄 Expect: No
 n-stop singalongs and dancefloor chaos (the fun kind) A packed pub vibe wi
 th huge energy from the first song A setlist full of familiar bangers\, re
 charged and turned up If you’ve seen Disgraceland before\, you already k
 now what’s coming. If you haven’t\, this is your chance to fix that. T
 ickets are moving fast for this one. Get in early and don’t be the perso
 n hearing about it the next day 🎟️🍻
